WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.514
Veteran homelessness.

00:00:01.514 --> 00:00:05.920
Three to five thousand Canadian veterans are homeless on any given night.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:12.102
Veterans are overrepresented in shelter populations by two to four times their proportion of the general population.
